# v299 — DEPLOYMENT CERTIFICATION GUARD
#
# This release. It adds the deployment-certification layer itself: the manifest
# format, the verifier, the negative controls, the proof, and the gate that runs
# before any release is declared deployable.
#
# It creates no database object. The guard reads catalog views and writes
# nothing — a verification layer that needed its own schema would be a
# contradiction.
#
# min_release v298 makes this release's own check walk the entire chain from
# v292a forward, so certifying v299 exercises the traversal it introduces
# against every release that preceded it.
release          v299
migration
migration_source none
min_release      v298
